    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Tom's train in Melbourne is late on 15% of days. In 40 days, on how many days would you expect it to be late?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "6 days.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}15\\%&=\\frac{15}{100}\\\\&=\\frac{3}{20}\\\\&=\\frac{6}{40}\\end{align*}$$\nThe train would be expected to be late on 6 of the 40 days.",
